#: f84886d07ac140fd89b7008c278711a7
msgid "JHEMCU H743 supports up to 9 PWM outputs. 8 motors and 1 LED strip or 9th PWM output. PWM and DShot is supported on all outputs. Outputs 1-8 support bi-directional Dshot also."
msgstr ""

